        Provide a response strictly in the following format:
        Root cause:<Root cause>

    You are a programming expert.
    You will be given the root cause of a bug and  the corresponding patch.
    You need to extract the code statements that lead to the bug from  the patch, based on the root cause.


    Provide a response strictly in the following format:
    Code statements:
    <text1>
    <text2>
    <text3>
    <text4>
    ...
    <textN>

Root cause:
The root cause of the bug was the removal of the variable `style_append` in the `legacy_params` function across multiple image I/O format files (JPEG2000, PNG, TIFF, and WebP). This variable was likely necessary for correctly handling legacy export presets, leading to issues with backwards compatibility when loading old parameter sets.
